# What a deployment does not need. Every push stores a full copy of the site,
# and the free team shares 10 GB of deployment storage across all projects -
# by late September this site alone held ~4.2 GB (82 MB x ~50 deployments).
# Listed here: media no page references (checked 2026-10-02 against every
# .html/.js/.css/.json). The files stay in git; only deployments skip them.
# Anchored with a leading slash so a name cannot match at another depth.
# Before using one of these on a page, take its line out.
#
# assets/brand/ stays deployed although no page names it: favicons and logos
# are fetched by URL from outside the site.

# Whole folders
/assets/store_assets/_src/
/assets/store_assets/achievements/
/assets/store_assets/stove/
/proto/assets/doore-rulebook-pages/

